{"id":"7fa4b726f0a3069e","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-baker-gill-solovay.md","title":"Oracle Separation","display":"thm-baker-gill-solovay — Oracle Separation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-baker-gill-solovay","aliases":["28-thm-baker-gill-solovay","Baker-Gill-Solovay Theorem"],"display":"thm-baker-gill-solovay — Oracle Separation","depends_on":["[[28-df-p]]","[[28-df-np]]","[[28-df-oracle-class]]","[[28-df-relativization]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-baker-gill-solovay"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-baker-gill-solovay</span><span>Baker-Gill-Solovay Theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-baker-gill-solovay — Oracle Separation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd9febae42d44280\" href=\"?note=dd9febae42d44280\" title=\"28-df-p\">28-df-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f4ae5e0b4d42d561\" href=\"?note=f4ae5e0b4d42d561\" title=\"28-df-oracle-class\">28-df-oracle-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f63fcc28a9b7afe5\" href=\"?note=f63fcc28a9b7afe5\" title=\"28-df-relativization\">28-df-relativization</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P\">\\(\\mathbf P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}\">\\(\\mathbf{NP}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dd9febae42d44280\" href=\"?note=dd9febae42d44280\" title=\"28-df-p\">28-df-p</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P^A\">\\(\\mathbf P^A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}^A\">\\(\\mathbf{NP}^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f4ae5e0b4d42d561\" href=\"?note=f4ae5e0b4d42d561\" title=\"28-df-oracle-class\">28-df-oracle-class</a>；元语言谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rel}\">\\(\\operatorname{Rel}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f63fcc28a9b7afe5\" href=\"?note=f63fcc28a9b7afe5\" title=\"28-df-relativization\">28-df-relativization</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists A,B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\left(\\mathbf P^A=\\mathbf{NP}^A\\land\\mathbf P^B\\ne\\mathbf{NP}^B\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists A,B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\left(\\mathbf P^A=\\mathbf{NP}^A\\land\\mathbf P^B\\ne\\mathbf{NP}^B\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\operatorname{Rel}(\\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP})\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Rel}(\\mathbf P\\ne\\mathbf{NP}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\operatorname{Rel}(\\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP})\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Rel}(\\mathbf P\\ne\\mathbf{NP}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>相等预言机可取 EXPCOM：一次查询能完成指数时间计算，而 NP 预言机分支枚举和每次查询本身可在指数时间模拟。分离预言机按阶段对每台确定型预言机机器选择足够长的一元输入：至多亚指数步只查到该长度全部串中的一部分，回答均先为否；若机器接受则该长度全部设为否，若拒绝则把一个未查串设为是。于是“存在某个该长度的串在预言机中”的一元语言属于相对 NP，却被每台相对 P 机误判。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定理3.7及证明；印刷74–75页；PDF100–101页。两个预言机构造及阶段保留论证已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-p","status":"resolved","id":"dd9febae42d44280","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-oracle-class","status":"resolved","id":"f4ae5e0b4d42d561","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-oracle-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-relativization","status":"resolved","id":"f63fcc28a9b7afe5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-relativization]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-p","status":"resolved","id":"dd9febae42d44280","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf P$、$\\mathbf{NP}$ 分别见 [[28-df-p]]、[[28-df-np]]；$\\mathbf P^A$、$\\mathbf{NP}^A$ 见 [[28-df-oracle-class]]；元语言谓词 $\\operatorname{Rel}$ 见 [[28-df-relativization]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf P$、$\\mathbf{NP}$ 分别见 [[28-df-p]]、[[28-df-np]]；$\\mathbf P^A$、$\\mathbf{NP}^A$ 见 [[28-df-oracle-class]]；元语言谓词 $\\operatorname{Rel}$ 见 [[28-df-relativization]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-oracle-class","status":"resolved","id":"f4ae5e0b4d42d561","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf P$、$\\mathbf{NP}$ 分别见 [[28-df-p]]、[[28-df-np]]；$\\mathbf P^A$、$\\mathbf{NP}^A$ 见 [[28-df-oracle-class]]；元语言谓词 $\\operatorname{Rel}$ 见 [[28-df-relativization]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-relativization","status":"resolved","id":"f63fcc28a9b7afe5","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf P$、$\\mathbf{NP}$ 分别见 [[28-df-p]]、[[28-df-np]]；$\\mathbf P^A$、$\\mathbf{NP}^A$ 见 [[28-df-oracle-class]]；元语言谓词 $\\operatorname{Rel}$ 见 [[28-df-relativization]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists A,B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\left(\\mathbf P^A=\\mathbf{NP}^A\\land\\mathbf P^B\\ne\\mathbf{NP}^B\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\operatorname{Rel}(\\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP})\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Rel}(\\mathbf P\\ne\\mathbf{NP}).","display":true}],"bytes":1525,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-77","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"预言机：[[28-df-oracle-tm]]、[[28-df-oracle-class]]、[[28-df-turing-reduction]]、[[28-df-relativization]]、[[28-thm-baker-gill-solovay]]。"}],"outgoing":["dd9febae42d44280","0cb5248561455df8","f4ae5e0b4d42d561","f63fcc28a9b7afe5"]}